# build/ is the source of truth for everything in Config/, Templates/ and
# Transition/ — nothing generated is ignored.
#
# Deploy/ holds one subfolder per real deployment: the customer's manifest
# (tenant IDs, exit dates, owners) and any instantiated templates that
# build/generate.py --instance writes. Those never belong in the public repo.
# The example manifest DOES ship, so ignore subfolders only, not the folder.
Deploy/*/
